                "message": "CHANGELOG: nightly tidy for 2026-11-06\n\nAdd the PRs merged since the last tidy (#290, #293, #294, #295, #298,\n#299) to their feature sets, bring the keymap line up to date with #294\nand the open #296/#297, add the open #300 to Being developed, and write\nthe new module-doc entries in the nested-bullet format of #295.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG",
